        "procedure": "Through a hydrogen bubble template strategy, Kwak and co-workers successfully fabricated hierarchical structured Ru-and RuO2-foams as binder- and carbon-free electrocatalysts on SS. The surface of SS was fully covered by self-supported film with spiny Cu-Ru cactus thorns. The dendritic Ru-foam consisted of numerous nano-sized foam units to form a highly porous, bracken-like structure.",
